&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;There are a variety of drug addiction resources available in Redmond that cater to&amp;nbsp;different needs&amp;nbsp;and preferences.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Some of the&amp;nbsp;addiction&amp;nbsp;resources are:&amp;nbsp;BestCare, New Priorities, Rimrock Trails&amp;nbsp;Treatment Services, and Deschutes County Behavioral Health.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If you are suffering from drug addiction,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can you reach out to Deschutes County Behavioral Health at 541-322-7500, where an Access Team can&amp;nbsp;route you the&amp;nbsp;best services available.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
